TWLBase_supplyInBucket
├── given bucket is enabled
│   ├── when amount is less or equal max uint
│   │   ├── it should decrease the bucket's totalDeposits by the given amount
│   │   └── it should not affect other buckets
│   ├── when amount is greater than max uint
│   │   └── it should revert
└── given bucket is disabled
    └── it should revert